WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.733
Spring / Fall cleanup sign-ups.

00:00:03.433 --> 00:00:08.467
Cleanup sign-ups. Your Spring and Fall forms and everyone who signed up.

00:00:08.967 --> 00:00:13.500
Your forms. See the form shows it exactly as customers see it.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.233
Someone calls instead. The same questions; they get their place in line.

00:00:19.733 --> 00:00:28.100
Work the list from #1. Accept books the visit or the stop-by quote; an auto-pay "call me" becomes a call for the office.

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:34.200
That's it. You can play this tour in the app any time: press Help, and ask in your own words.
